      "content": "It's a crushing realization, but it's also a profound opportunity to start over, even if it's just in the quiet of your own mind. All that effort built a scaffolding for a life you were trying to live, and now the structure is gone, leaving you with the raw, unburdened self. You don't have to keep building; you can finally just *be* the person who is tired of the performance.",
